+        "for k<n/2, instantiated here with balanced planted 3-CNF conflict "
+        "graphs at 6 clauses per variable; at the shipping preset the exact bitset "
+        "branch-and-color attack exhausts its measured node cap without a "
+        "certificate on all eight audit seeds."
