codex
The G9 diagnostics are running concurrently in their own scratch directories. The first placebo attempt solved the shipping instance (1/1 so far), showing that prompt perturbation alone can matter; this is exactly why the placebo control is recorded. No diagnostic result changes the shipping gate, which remains the size/effort cap plus the bare hardened evidence.
