/bin/bash -lc 'sleep 50
for d in g9_hinted g9_placebo; do echo "$d $(wc -l < "$d/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl")"; tail -n 2 "$d/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl"; done' in /home/gson/gvrepo/results/1811.04560
codex
The first placebo attempt unexpectedly solved its instance, which is exactly why the placebo control is useful: an improvement over bare cannot automatically be attributed to structural information. The structural-hint arm has not yet returned its first result. These diagnostics do not gate shipment under the current contract.
