+NOTES = r"""
+Section 2, Definition 2.1 fixes Konig to mean equality between maximum-matching
+size and minimum-vertex-cover size.  Lemma 2.2 supplies the executable witness:
+a vertex cover S and a matching across (S,V-S) saturating S.  Section 3 is the
+decisive construction.  Claim 3.3 maps an independent set I to the private
+edges {V_i,P_i}; its proof writes both S=(V-I) union C and a matching of the
+same size.  Claim 3.4 proves the converse, while Corollary 3.1 proves that no
+smaller deletion set exists.
