Completed and ready to ship.

The generator uses a Track B affine-holonomy family, carried through the paper’s Section 3 reduction to König Edge Deletion ([paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.04560)). The witness is planted by construction and verified using exact modular constraints.

Key results:

